            <title>[IGNITE-11119] Test IgniteCacheQueryH2IndexingLeakTest#testLeaksInIgniteH2IndexingOnTerminatedThread is not stable</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-11119</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;The test &lt;tt&gt;IgniteCacheQueryH2IndexingLeakTest#testLeaksInIgniteH2IndexingOnTerminatedThread&lt;/tt&gt; is &lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/project.html?projectId=IgniteTests24Java8&amp;amp;testNameId=-7378154946319099847&amp;amp;tab=testDetails&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;not stable&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Root cause:&lt;/b&gt; the await period is too short.&lt;br/&gt;
